WEBVTT

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.340
That outfit of yours is truly lovely!

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.180
It's very dreamy-cute!

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.940
Hurry, hurry! Let's chat about a 
whole bunch of stuff together!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.240
The desserts are really good, too!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:43.340
Now, eat up, Sunflower!

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.250
I'm not the one who's mad.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:36.060
This world is mad.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.160
Mother...

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.520
She hasn't responded to my texts lately.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.070
There's no mention of her in the gossiper.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.720
Is there anyone who knows about her?

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.280
Seriously, what's happening here?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.330
A tea party?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.670
<b>SweetP's tea party</b>

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.080
<b>All information finds its way here 
to this social gathering of ladies.</b>

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.790
<b>Participants
Dreamy-Cute Girls Only</b>

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.290
<b>Location
Shopping Mall
Vavico, Crescent Moon Rabbit</b>

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.290
<b>We'll be waiting in a dreamy-cute 
world with sweet desserts!</b>

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.550
All information...

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.060
Mother...

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.310
Dissonance has begun to play 
and disturbs our Mobius.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:45.990
You understand, right? We can't 
afford to let them awaken.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.180
Mobius is built from everyone's dreams, too.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:51.830
Some people just can't get a clue.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.740
They'd be happy living in this world, too.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.480
What wasteful actions.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.010
They're unforgivable.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:03.220
No mercy for them.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.430
It's hard to understand them.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:08.260
This is the problem with Rogues.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.880
Well, it appears we have some musicians

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.890
who were beaten back by those Rogues.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.110
We Musicians are Mobius's tuners.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.070
We must correct this distortion in our world,

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.260
for the sake of perfect 
happiness, and for μ's sake.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:30.160
Well, there's at least one of us
 who barely bothers to show up.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:35.370
Here, here, Thorn-chan! 
Leave this to dreamy-cute me!

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.340
I've taken a liking to her.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.790
She's slender, healthy...

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.610
And I just want to crush her.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.050
We must give the heretics guidance.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.430
That is our destiny as Ostinato Musicians.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.980
Hey, Suzuna.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.400
This is a library, right?

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.920
Are you sure this place is okay?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:01.610
Yes.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:07.370
But still, you also, well... back there...

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.990
You realized it, too, right? The truth.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.520
No, it's nothing!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:20.340
More importantly, those strange 
things might attack us again.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.090
Will you be all right on your own?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.930
Hardly any Kishimai students 
come to this library.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:32.510
Oh! Right, the pointy ones that attacked us
 were all wearing our school uniform!

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:35.130
So I'll be safe here.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:38.380
I see. Then I'll contact you again later.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.600
If you're ever in trouble, 
just give me a call.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:42.780
N-No, you don't have to.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.640
H-Hey...

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:49.700
Kagura Suzuna, there.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.130
Don't worry about it.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.830
It wouldn't be a rescue if we didn't
 make sure we're both safe.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.920
Later.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:02.340
I'm going to take a look around to see 
whether anyone else is in trouble like us.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.800
I wonder if he's here.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.170
I'm sorry.

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:32.700
I haven't created anything past this point yet.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:37.750
Right now, I can't create any 
farther regions for Mobius.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:41.610
I can create anything else you'd like, though.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:42.730
What would you like?

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.040
A new family?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.200
Friends? Or...

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.670
<i>If what μ said back then 
is to be believed,</i>

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.680
<i>then this world is artificial.</i>

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.390
<i>That's the only explanation.</i>

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>Someone once said,</i>

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.160
<i>"If I were to save the world,"</i>

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:07.180
<i>"I would spend 59 minutes 
understanding the problem"</i>

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:10.700
<i>"and one minute resolving it."</i>

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:15.670
<i>That's the important part: 
understanding this world.</i>

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.660
<i>Not seeking an easy resolution.</i>

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:20.980
<i>Think. Think about it.</i>

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:34.920
<i>There's a fantastical, milky, dreamy-cute 
tea party for girls starting at 10 o'clock!</i>

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.420
I should be able to find out here.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.020
Dreamy-cute...

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:54.030
Ladies and pretty girls!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:58.390
Welcome to SweetP's tea party!

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:02.290
Now, enjoy today to the depths of your being!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.360
Sit wherever you like!

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.170
What leaves would you like?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:10.380
I recommend the Earl Grey.
 It matches today's snacks perfectly!

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:14.440
We're the flower princesses, 
and we welcome you!

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:16.040
I look forward to chatting!

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.640
There are lots of snacks to eat, too!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:24.730
Man, I'm super lucky getting to 
participate in SweetP's tea party!

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.560
U-Uh, is this...

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.060
Yes!

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.230
The center of social life for 
ladies, admired by all girls.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.860
The secret party where all manner 
of wonderful secret tales

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:36.370
and hidden rumors are exchanged!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.200
That's SweetP's tea party.

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:43.790
Wow, made fresh!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.080
This is great!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.280
Yes.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:48.130
This is it, taking photos!

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.130
I should be able to gather all 
kinds of information here.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:52.250
Uh-huh. Let's share lots of stories.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:55.930
So, what's the name of our new friend?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:59.140
M-Mifue. Shinohara Mifue.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.970
Shinoha...

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:07.020
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.900
Using your real name won't work here.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.160
You have to go by a fairy name.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.610
F-Fairy?

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.950
You have a fairy name, right?

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.320
I'm Rose.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.350
I'm Lily.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.030
I'm Iris.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.250
By the way, I'm Snapdragon.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.370
The names of flowers?

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.710
U-Uh, then, S-Sunflower!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.710
Uh-huh, that's a cute name.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.670
Nice to meet you, Sunflower.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.130
Y-Yes.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.840
So, I'm looking for my mother.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.190
Non non, non non.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:43.270
No sour looks like that here!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.180
You have to be more dreamy-cute!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.490
But...

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:49.400
If you don't, then we can't 
chat together, you know?

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:57.070
H-Hello! I'm Sunflower. Nice to meet you.

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:03.920
I want to have fun chatting 
with you all, too, meow!

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.410
Let me in, meow!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.120
Mmm, very cute!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.630
Very dreamy cute!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.130
Now, everyone, let's start the tea party!

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.080
I won't keep you here any more.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.710
But if you feel like talking...

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.760
The music prep room...

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:04.680
Out of time, huh?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:12.190
Oh, Rosie! When did you 
buy such a cute accessory?

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:16.820
My, you noticed it? I had it 
hand-made at the usual shop.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:19.100
Wow, I'm so jealous!

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.030
Mind if I print this in the gossiper?

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:24.590
W-Wow, I want one, too!

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:28.870
S-So, I'd like to hear about my mother.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:32.120
Iris, your <i>chouchou</i> scrunchie is cute, too!

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.480
It's so pretty!

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:35.540
Hey, hey!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.780
Would you like to listen to my stories?!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:40.090
So, Sunflower, are you having fun?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.470
Y-Yes! I'm having a wonderful time!

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.610
Everyone's just so cute!

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:46.470
So cute...

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:54.030
All kinds of secrets find their 
way here to my secret tea party.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.340
Even those about your acquaintance.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:01.020
But first, let's enjoy chatting together!

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:05.040
Sunflower, what kind of snacks do you like?

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.460
Oh, uh, macarons?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:12.540
Then here, have some of my macarons!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.590
Th-Thanks...

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:18.380
How many sugar cubes would you like 
in your tea? Three? Four?

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.660
Y-You don't need to make mine that sweet.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:25.760
Now, now. No need to hold back!

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:31.390
M-More importantly,
 I'm looking for someone!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.730
Hey, look!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:36.440
These frills are really cute!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.270
Hey!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.360
Everyone, would you chat with me, too?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:45.360
No, no. You don't have 
enough dreamy-cuteness.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.210
This chocolate's great!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:50.570
I want to be a part of this, too.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.700
Leaving me out is boo, boo!

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.250
That's very cute!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:59.710
What, what? What would you 
like to talk about, Sunflower?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.000
M-My mother—

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.610
Now, everyone!

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:03.590
It's time for the second round of snacks!

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:06.680
Of course there's extra, extra cream!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.560
Yay!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:20.810
Looks delicious!

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.070
Time to enjoy some!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:33.050
It's fluffy and melts in your mouth!

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:34.280
<i>A chiffon moon</i>

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:39.980
<i>circles around a lace sun,</i>

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.920
More! More!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:45.600
<i>and I rub my sleepy eyes by the window.</i>

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:43.560
It's like it's feeding time!

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:51.430
<i>I want to be loved more than others.</i>

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:59.130
<i>I dream of drowning in a sea of tea,</i>

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:56.480
Those macarons are mine.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.480
Please don't take them!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.150
Those are mine!

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:06.350
<i>but I don't want to leave, 
so please don't wake me.</i>

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.420
My, don't fight!

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:06.780
Go on, Sunflower. Don't hold back. Eat up!

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:10.440
<i>I'm embraced in a silk bed,</i>

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.190
Go on, Sunflower.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.560
Go on, Sunflower.

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:10.740
Sunflower!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:14.200
<i>but I'm still sleepy, so stop the alarm.</i>

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.050
Sunflower!

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.200
You fat slobs.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:15.850
Filthy!

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:18.270
Filthy, filthy, filthy, filthy, filthy!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.530
What is wrong with you?!

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:24.330
You keep chatting about nonsense, oinking 
away with food crammed in your mouths!

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:27.800
Screw dreamy-cute! Are you idiots?!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.390
You won't even listen to others!

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.550
Do you have marshmallows 
stuffed in your ears?!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.140
S-Sunflower?

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.890
I hate you fatties!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:37.240
None of you has any tact,

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.640
and you don't even care how much 
of a nuisance you are to others!

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.630
Eating is the only thing on your minds,

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:44.570
and you chomp-chomp-chomp 
away at anything like pigs!

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:47.470
Then you wear those clothes that 
don't even match your figures,

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:49.950
grossing out everyone around you!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.920
Don't you understand people 
are laughing at you?!

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.910
Don't you realize how disgusting you are?!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.750
You're a nuisance!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.650
So those are your true feelings?

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:06.730
You hate fat people that much, huh?

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.970
So that's why you erased your mother.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.970
<b>Why do we live? The further we purse the 
meaning of life, the more confused we become.</b>

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:16.300
You're lucky, Mifue.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.810
You don't gain weight from eating.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:22.820
Well, take your time and enjoy it, Mifue.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.520
Hey, is it fun here?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.530
Huh?

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.110
Tell me, Mifue.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.490
Yeah.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.850
But I wish I could eat dinner with my mother.

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.370
Mother's so gaunt.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.440
All right! That'll bring you happiness, then?

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.140
It was cold out today, right?

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.080
So I'm making a stew.

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.690
I wanted to eat some, too.

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:49.460
I hope it turns out well.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.220
Right, Mifue-chan?

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.240
Mother?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.600
You're looking for your erased mother?

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:06.470
After μ went to the lengths 
of preparing you a new one?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.910
No!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:11.860
I never asked her to change my mother!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:15.150
No, you wished for it.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:16.990
μ just granted your wish.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.080
Shut up! Be quiet!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.640
Where is my mother?!

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.800
All rumors find way their way here, right?!

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:23.790
Quit avoiding it!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.920
You still don't understand after coming here?

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.260
You tricked me?!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.630
You've realized it, right?

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:40.770
You,

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.480
yourself,

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.940
erased

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.610
your mother!

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.010
No!

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:52.030
You're really selfish, getting so upset

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:52.030
No! No! No! No!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.650
after your wish was granted.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:54.650
No!

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.530
You're self-centered,

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.160
egotistical,

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:04.080
and you harbor an awful lot 
of hatred toward ugly things.

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:08.040
You sure dissed the appearance

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.800
of the flower princesses a great deal,

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.550
but your heart's ugly, too.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:19.140
I-I'm not ugly.

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.470
Oh, really?

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.200
You're searching for your mother
 only to satisfy yourself, right?

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:27.950
"Sorry for erasing you, Mother!"

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.030
What an egotist.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:32.820
Such filthy thoughts, such an ugly heart...

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.070
No... No...

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:39.210
This is a world where anything 
you wish for will be granted.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:43.900
It can make a lovely mother for you, 
and you can become whoever you want to be.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.000
Oh, does this mean the real you is—

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.310
Stop!

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:54.130
Enough...

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.590
Stop already.

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.070
Hey, Sunflower, are you okay?

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:02.560
Does your stomach hurt?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.060
Here in this world,

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.440
you don't have to recall anything unpleasant.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:12.920
See? μ will grant any wish.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.060
She'll make all the unpleasantness go away.

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:18.450
There's no need to worry about anything.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.990
You don't have to think.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.900
You can let yourself go 
as your heart desires.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:31.000
Here, order's ready!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.630
It's here!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.880
It looks so good!

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.470
Huh?! You're going to eat more?!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.280
Ramen's a dessert!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:43.180
It's my favorite, sweet fat!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:46.890
Hm? Where have I heard that line?

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.600
Time to eat!

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.020
Hm...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.540
Finished off, thanks!

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:11.520
That line, flipping the finished bowl...

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:14.290
Huh? Nijouin Shizuka?

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.340
Nijouin?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.220
Uh, who was that?

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:23.240
A ramen blogger... and a chubby old man?

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:25.640
Don't call me old or chubby!

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:35.560
A world where any wish is granted...

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.380
You can become whoever you want to be?

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.650
Whoever you want to be?

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:44.430
Don't look! Don't say anything!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.240
I am SweetP!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:49.400
This world's most dreamy-cute musician,

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:53.450
full of frilly clothes and sweet desserts!

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:57.630
Hm? I don't really understand, 
but I'll take some photos.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.360
No!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:08.660
Don't take photos of my ugly self!

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:13.420
I see. So that man also...

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.440
So what was all that about in the end?

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:20.860
I wonder what that was.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.780
Well, the tea party wasn't 
lacking in material, at least.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.560
Hey, you snapped back there, right?

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.200
Do you hate fat people that much?

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.410
I loathe them.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:36.830
Now, spreading, spreading!

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.250
I haven't stopped getting 
notifications since posting

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:42.410
that photo of SweetP spewing ramen.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.160
Huh?! What is this?!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:49.040
Huh? The pictures of the 
fighter Satake Shogo...

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.640
The... pictures have...

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.030
M-Monsters?!

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.020
They're here, too?!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:59.050
Did you just now realize it?

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:07.490
<b>Let's blow the horn on 
this world full of static!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:25.640
You seem to have finally accepted it.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:29.420
You know about this world, right?

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:31.890
Leave it to me! I'll explain everything.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:34.770
Is your mind ready?

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:35.480
Yes.

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:37.210
Very well.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:40.440
But in return, you'll be working with me.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.260
Me? Working with you?

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:44.030
Yes.

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:48.060
Since we've both realized 
the structure of this Mobius.

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.440
Mobius...

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:56.000
Yeah, this world is a nightmare 
we can't wake up from.

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Episode 4
People who do not respect themselves 
will not be respected by others.</b>

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:30.280
Caligula aphorisms,100 yen each.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.280
I'll take one!

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:37.520
People who do not respect themselves 
will not be respected by others.

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:40.300
I'll try again tomorrow!
